@startuml
' DRAFT Developer,19.10.2026; InputSHA07bb56b; direct Owner preparation, no G3.
title DRAFT: passive SVG, revision-local surface and guarded clone/install
autonumber
hide footbox
participant "Session accept owner" as Session
control "ResultController" as Result
participant "Retained HTML presenter" as HTML
participant "Private live DOM adapter" as DOM
participant "Revision-local surface" as Surface
participant "Passive renderer" as Wheel
actor User
Session -> Result : accepted B, acceptanceSeq/cause/submitted snapshot
Result -> DOM : revoke old instance/revision; remove imagery A
Result -> Surface : detach retired surface
Result -> Result : full-B S1 index; once policy/reconcile
Result -> HTML : publish B facts/summary, retained keyed controls
alt instance replacement
  Result -> Wheel : guarded synchronous dispose retired leaf, once
  alt dispose throws
    Wheel --> Result : retired diagnostic
    Result -> Result : retain HTML B; continue new draw
  end
else same instance, new revision
  Result -> Result : keep instance; old revision already revoked
end
Result -> Surface : create private connected measurement surface
Result -> Wheel : update deep copied/frozen B, surface, captured publish
Wheel -> Surface : measure native SVG/fonts; draw own root
Wheel -> DOM : publish(own SVG, captured lease)
DOM -> DOM : current guard; validate passive SVG; clone
DOM -> DOM : recheck lease after clone; synchronous install copy
alt current valid
  DOM --> Wheel : committed
else revoked/reentrant invalidation
  DOM --> Wheel : revoked; no live write
end
alt current factory/sync update/async rejection
  Wheel --> Result : typed local SVG failure
  Result -> DOM : revoke failed lease; clear only imagery
  Result -> HTML : local warning; keep HTML B
else stale failure / callback
  Wheel --> Result : retired revision diagnostic
  Result -> Result : no B warning/state/DOM mutation
else success
  Wheel --> Result : update completed
  Result -> Surface : retain current surface until revoke
end
Wheel -> DOM : current late font callback publish
DOM -> DOM : same guards + fresh clone; stale lease always refused
User -> HTML : native point/aspect action
HTML -> Result : canonical intent from live control
Result -> HTML : keyed patch, no planet focus/scroll
Result -> Result : new presentation revision, same acceptanceSeq
Result -> Wheel : display updated selection through new lease
note over Session, Wheel
SVG has no selection controls, tabindex or Q44.
Selection/resize/SVG leaf fault does not issue HTTP.
HTML/controller unexpected fault uses existing safe-read.
28 isolated controls; actual production path still future.
end note
@enduml
